+# Fetching notes
+
+Values below come from this project's session history (Svipall fetch logs), not from a
+file checked into this repo — `GATE1.md` only says fetching was rate-limited, without
+numbers.
+
+## Rate limit
+
+- 12 visits per 60 s window, per domain.
+- Breach cooldown: 900 s before that domain is tried again.
+
+## Mirror / CDN hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — primary, confirmed in `manifest.tsv` header.
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>` — fallback mirror.
+- `cdn.statically.io` — fallback mirror, slow, frequent timeouts.
